=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_8c2e — Marco works from the living room mid-day; laptop at the coffee table

Two remote workers share this home. Marco works from home but does not stay at his bedroom desk all day. The evidence is clear: his laptop, water bottle, and charger are all at desk_b1 at 09:00 and 17:00 but absent from the desk during the 10-to-16 stretch (19 empty looks for the laptop, 19 for the water bottle, 22 for the charger). Meanwhile, his notebook and pen remain at desk_b1 throughout the day (notebook found at 11:00 ×3, 15:00, 17:00, 18:00 ×2). This suggests Marco keeps his reference materials (notebook, pen) at the desk but carries his active work setup (laptop, water bottle, charger) to the living room during the middle of the work day — perhaps for a change of posture, a video call, or a more comfortable chair. Omar, by contrast, also roams to the coffee table with his own laptop and charger.

What sets this apart: p_a1b2 and p_f4a7 keep Marco's laptop at desk_b1 (open or bagged). This document predicts it is at coffee_table_l1 during 11–16 on weekdays. The water bottle and charger follow the laptop. The notebook and pen stay at desk_b1.

What would refute this: laptop_marco sighted at desk_b1 at 13:00 on a weekday (it should be at the coffee table), or water_bottle_marco sighted at desk_b1 at 14:00 on a weekday.

